        "original_id": "90892ac2-062a-572d-bf3f-96f147f8dc7b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Gary Payton, Shawn Kemp, Barry Ackerley\n- Organizations: Seattle SuperSonics, Naismith Basketball Hall of Fame\n- Events: 1994 NBA All-Star Game, 1996 NBA All-Star Game\n- Roles: point guard, owner, Defensive Player of the Year\n\nFacts:\n- Barry Ackerley was the owner of the Seattle SuperSonics basketball franchise from 1983 to 2001.\n- Gary Payton started at the point guard position.\n- In 1994, Gary Payton made his first All-Star appearance when he was selected for the 1994 NBA All-Star Game along with Shawn Kemp.\n- In 1996, Shawn Kemp and Gary Payton, who was the Defensive Player of the Year, were both selected for the 1996 NBA All-Star Game.\n- Gary Payton was inducted into the Naismith Basketball Hall of Fame on September 8, 2013.",
